@startuml deployment
!include _style.iuml
title CivicLink: Deployment and Runtime (assessed configuration)

node "Assessor / developer machine\n(Linux · macOS · Windows)" as PC {
  node "Node.js 22" {
    artifact "Vite dev server :5173\n(apps/web)" as Vite
    artifact "seed script\n(scripts/seed.ts)" as Seed
  }
  node "Firebase Emulator Suite\n(firebase-tools, Java 21)" as EMU {
    component "Auth emulator :9099" as EA
    component "Firestore emulator :8080\n+ firestore.rules" as EF
    component "Functions emulator :5001\n(functions/lib/index.js)" as EFN
    component "Storage emulator :9199\n+ storage.rules" as ES
    component "Emulator UI :4000" as EUI
  }
}
node "User device\n(browser: Chrome, Firefox,\nmobile Chrome)" as Browser {
  artifact "CivicLink SPA" as SPA
}
cloud "Internet" {
  node "tile.openstreetmap.org" as OSM
}

Browser --> Vite : HTTP (load SPA)
SPA --> EA : HTTP
SPA --> EF : WebChannel / gRPC-web\n(listeners)
SPA --> EFN : HTTPS callable
SPA --> ES : HTTP upload/download
SPA --> OSM : HTTPS tiles
EFN --> EF
EFN --> EA
EFN --> ES
Seed --> EF
Seed --> EA

note bottom of EMU
  Optional cloud deployment (same code):
  Firebase Hosting (SPA) + Cloud Functions (africa-south1)
  + Firestore + Storage + Auth, Blaze plan with budget alert.
end note
@enduml
